          "gloss": "The Holy Place",
          "article": "realia:TheHolyPlace",
          "description": "The inner room of the Tabernacle and Jerusalem Temple where sacred rituals were performed."
        }
      ]
    },
    "apd": {
      "preferred_label": "القدس",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "الأوضة الجوانية في خيمة الاجتماع وهيكل أورشليم الكانت بتتعمل فيها الطقوس المقدسة."
        }
      ]
    },
    "arb": {
      "preferred_label": "القدس",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
